  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gan-Hithadhoo Link Road of the First Regional Development Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at developing the Southern Region centered on the Gan to Hithadhoo island chain in Seenu Atoll to reduce the in_migration to Male which is at constant pressure on its resources and associated demand for water, power, sewerage, solid waste and social services seriously threaten the environment and quality
of life. The Gan_Hithadhoo Link Road is a part of the infrastructure requirements to develop the region. The project comprises of: connstruction of 17 Km Road from Gan to Hithadhoo, social infrastructure, environmental improvement and institutional building for the project management.</narrative>
  </description>
